    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1762" root="بجح" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَجِحٌ</span></b>  <i>Rejoicing, glad,</i> or <i>happy;</i> as in the
phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إَنَا بَجَعٌ بِمَكَانِ كَذَا</span> [<i>I am rejoicing in
such a place</i>]; and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَبَجِّحٌ</span></b> . (A.)

